WEBVTT

00:02.920 --> 00:05.750
So, we have come to the unanimous decision
to appoint as the new club president...

00:03.750 --> 00:05.750
<b>Broadcasting Club</b>

00:06.040 --> 00:08.040
Shihono Kobayashi.

00:08.040 --> 00:09.170
I'll do my best!

00:10.540 --> 00:14.710
Us third years have to leave the Broadcasting Club
after the upcoming school festival.

00:14.880 --> 00:15.960
Prez...

00:15.960 --> 00:17.330
That's "former" president.

00:17.460 --> 00:19.670
The hassle of budget allocations for the festival,

00:19.670 --> 00:23.460
the ruthless lottery to secure the best location,
preparing the script for the dramatic reading,

00:23.460 --> 00:26.170
coming up with excuses when the student council
demands we tone down questionable scenes,

00:26.170 --> 00:27.130
and everything else...

00:27.130 --> 00:28.710
It's all up to you now!

00:28.710 --> 00:30.040
R-right!

00:30.290 --> 00:32.130
B-but that's everything.

00:32.290 --> 00:35.960
Well, if anything goes wrong
Endo can take responsibility.

00:35.960 --> 00:37.000
Exactly.

00:37.460 --> 00:39.250
Uh, why me?!

00:39.380 --> 00:42.380
Shihonon's a cutie, and therefore we can't yell at her.

00:42.380 --> 00:45.290
So as her official significant other
you get the brunt of our complaints!

00:45.290 --> 00:47.250
Uh, but... well...

00:47.380 --> 00:50.750
Then if you'll excuse us,
we must study for entrance exams.

00:53.130 --> 00:54.500
I'm sorry about that.

00:54.500 --> 00:59.250
Oh, not at all! If it means I can get yelled out
instead of you, I'd prefer that anyway!

01:00.420 --> 01:01.420
Thank you!

01:02.130 --> 01:03.790
Uh, don't mention it...

01:04.500 --> 01:08.040
Then let's dive right into
the script for the dramatic reading.

01:08.250 --> 01:09.750
We should decide on the material first.

01:09.750 --> 01:12.580
I WISH I were actually her significant other.

01:09.880 --> 01:12.250
Do any of you have ideas?

01:13.210 --> 01:16.750
Please notice these feelings I can't tell you

01:16.750 --> 01:22.880
I'll try to make you see with these skewed and clumsy words

01:23.130 --> 01:26.040
Just for you

01:35.290 --> 01:38.250
I always hide what I mean

01:38.250 --> 01:40.670
(so you don't realize my heart is pounding)

01:40.750 --> 01:45.920
It's all your fault for being far too stunning

01:46.170 --> 01:48.960
No way I can be cute

01:48.960 --> 01:50.710
(I mean, that's not me, is it?)

01:50.710 --> 01:53.540
Even the sky reflected in those eyes

01:53.540 --> 01:56.830
I can't bear to gaze at it straight on

01:56.830 --> 02:02.170
How long am I going to live in this world full of lies?

02:02.170 --> 02:07.080
I'll never manage to change anything at this rate

02:07.250 --> 02:09.790
I don't want that to happen

02:09.790 --> 02:15.920
Even if a god were to speak for me and tell you how I feel

02:15.920 --> 02:21.210
Someday, I want to tell you in my own words that I love you

02:21.460 --> 02:30.000
Even if the words are skewed,
before this precious feeling disappears somewhere

02:30.500 --> 02:33.210
I promise I'll find the courage

02:43.790 --> 02:47.630
<b>Chapter 9</b>

02:43.790 --> 02:47.630
<b>The Dress, the School Festival, and Overflowing Emotions</b>

02:46.630 --> 02:47.960
None of these are that great.

02:47.960 --> 02:51.290
I wouldn't really know, but aren't these
pretty typical of dramatic readings?

02:51.750 --> 02:57.500
You know, after seeing Sieg and Liese-tan's happy
scene, nothing seems nearly romantic enough to work.

02:57.750 --> 02:59.630
I don't think that's the best comparison...

03:00.880 --> 03:04.380
I know! We should just adapt
that scene as a dramatic reading!

03:04.830 --> 03:05.540
Huh?!

03:05.880 --> 03:08.380
Endo, can you please play the part of Sieg?

03:08.710 --> 03:09.750
What?!

03:10.000 --> 03:14.080
You want me to say those...
those cloyingly sweet lines by Sieg?!

03:14.460 --> 03:17.580
I really like your voice, Endo.

03:17.960 --> 03:22.290
Such a low, gentle, but deep and resounding voice.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.960
Hanahashi Ikuei, let's go!

03:20.250 --> 03:21.040
Let's go!

03:21.250 --> 03:21.920
Let's go!

03:21.920 --> 03:22.750
Yeah!

03:23.290 --> 03:27.040
I want to hear some sweet lines
in that voice! And record that!

03:27.040 --> 03:29.880
I'd keep it forever and play it on endless repeat!

03:30.290 --> 03:31.790
...is what I've always thought.

03:32.830 --> 03:39.000
If you could say Sieg's lines in your voice,
that would be worth preserving for posterity, I swear!

03:39.250 --> 03:42.920
I'd really love it if you could take the leap
and play the part of Sieg.

03:43.210 --> 03:44.880
I-if you...

03:45.500 --> 03:47.960
...agree to play Lieselotte's part, sure!

03:48.250 --> 03:48.920
Huh?

03:52.670 --> 03:54.130
Okay! I'll do it!

03:55.170 --> 03:58.080
That's so awesome! But...

03:58.670 --> 04:01.630
I want you to think so, and believe in me.

04:02.630 --> 04:03.710
I love you.

04:04.500 --> 04:06.460
I really have to say those lines?!

04:07.460 --> 04:13.290
Not only do I get to introduce everyone to Sieg
and Liese-tan, I get to hear you play Sieg as well!

04:13.290 --> 04:14.330
Okay, then...

04:14.750 --> 04:16.000
We have to do this!

04:16.920 --> 04:18.630
Let me start writing up the script.

04:19.040 --> 04:21.250
But we have to keep up with Magikoi, too!

04:21.500 --> 04:22.580
Let's see...

04:23.580 --> 04:25.500
Guess it's just my voice she likes, huh?

04:26.290 --> 04:31.210
For all they say about us being a couple,
she doesn't think of me in that way at all...

04:36.170 --> 04:39.250
About my attire for the Festival of Gratitude.

04:40.710 --> 04:42.380
Please prepare something like this.

04:45.210 --> 04:46.830
Is this sports wear?

04:46.830 --> 04:49.670
Um, care to explain, Liese?

04:50.080 --> 04:55.580
As the gods have foretold, the Witch of Yore will return
after the ball during the Festival of Gratitude, no?

04:55.920 --> 04:59.420
A key rule of combat is to wear clothes
that allow freedom of movement.

05:00.210 --> 05:04.290
Just wait until I get my hands on her... that Witch of Yore!

05:04.290 --> 05:06.670
Lieselotte is all set to go into combat!

05:06.670 --> 05:09.250
She looks ready to take on the witch all by herself.

05:09.250 --> 05:12.130
But I don't know about wearing sports wear to a ball.

05:12.380 --> 05:15.790
Liese, you know you're not
the only one who's going to fight!

05:15.920 --> 05:17.830
There's Art and the others, and the general as well.

05:18.040 --> 05:21.040
I think it might be better to attend the ball in formal dress.

05:21.040 --> 05:24.210
That's right! Besides, I'm looking forward to it, you know.

05:24.540 --> 05:27.210
Seeing my lovely sister dressed up to the nines.

05:28.750 --> 05:33.790
The Witch of Yore is specifically after me.
This is no time to be reveling in frivolities!

05:35.080 --> 05:39.290
It's true that wearing high heels might
pose a problem when fighting.

05:39.290 --> 05:42.330
And the hem of a long dress would get in the way.

05:42.790 --> 05:44.960
Your arguments are fair, divine gods.

05:45.670 --> 05:50.040
But nevertheless, I wish to see Liese in adorable attire!

05:53.460 --> 05:55.380
Liese, remember what you promised?

05:55.920 --> 05:59.210
You said you would wear a dress
with gold to match my outfit.

05:59.210 --> 06:02.330
B-but what of the battle against the Witch of Yore...?

06:02.630 --> 06:06.540
Dressed in finery, you are more beautiful
than any magnificent flower.

06:06.540 --> 06:07.130
What-

06:08.460 --> 06:11.630
The stars and moon will shine to illuminate you,

06:12.000 --> 06:16.580
the fish will leap out of the water
in your honor and dance,

06:16.880 --> 06:20.380
and the birds will come down to earth and frolic,

06:21.290 --> 06:22.670
to laud your beauty.

06:23.630 --> 06:24.580
Whew...!

06:25.290 --> 06:27.040
Wh-what...

06:27.790 --> 06:32.630
Please, will you not show me
how splendid you look in special attire?

06:38.960 --> 06:40.420
Lieselotte ran away!

06:40.420 --> 06:43.000
I think that might have been a bit much.

06:43.330 --> 06:47.420
Lately, my feelings for Liese have
been overflowing beyond control.

06:48.330 --> 06:51.170
So what are you going to do about my sister's dress?

06:51.170 --> 06:54.290
It would be a shame to prepare something
and have her refuse to wear it.

06:54.750 --> 06:57.540
Maybe a dress that's easy to move
around in would work?

06:57.540 --> 07:00.540
Like an empire line dress that comes down to the ankles?

07:00.920 --> 07:07.130
Then perhaps I'll have them test out a dress that has as
loose a fit as possible and won't hinder her legs.

07:08.000 --> 07:09.040
Please excuse me.

07:09.040 --> 07:09.670
Hmm?

07:10.380 --> 07:12.170
Oh, Miss Fiene.

07:12.420 --> 07:13.500
Sir Bal!

07:13.960 --> 07:17.330
Your Highness, I have a message from Liese for you.

07:17.960 --> 07:18.830
For me?

07:19.170 --> 07:21.130
Yes. I was on my way here, when...

07:21.540 --> 07:22.460
Lieselotte?

07:23.790 --> 07:24.580
Bal!

07:25.920 --> 07:29.040
It seems she was too embarrassed to return to this room.

07:29.040 --> 07:29.830
Liese...

07:29.830 --> 07:31.250
Oh, dear.

07:31.710 --> 07:33.540
So? What is this message you have for me?

07:33.540 --> 07:34.250
Right.

07:34.580 --> 07:39.380
"Would you allow me to borrow the female uniform
for the royal guard?" she asks.

07:39.380 --> 07:40.130
Huh?

07:40.920 --> 07:43.750
Uh, for the royal guard? What kind of clothes are those?

07:43.750 --> 07:46.830
Military dress! Military dress in white with gold trim!

07:48.040 --> 07:50.290
White with gold... Those are my colors!

07:50.670 --> 07:53.040
An outfit with gold to match mine...

07:53.500 --> 07:56.210
My beloved Lieselotte is simply too cute!

07:56.420 --> 08:00.540
I wanna see Liese-tan in military dress!
Definitely wanna see her in such a rare outfit!

08:00.830 --> 08:04.750
That uniform would work to fight in,
with a design suited for a formal occasion.

08:05.080 --> 08:06.960
Sieg can't stop grinning!

08:06.960 --> 08:11.380
She could have chosen a knight's uniform, but she
specifically requested the royal guard's for its gold trim.

08:11.380 --> 08:13.540
He must have realized Liese-tan's intent!

08:13.540 --> 08:14.380
I did!

08:14.670 --> 08:15.790
What will you do, Fiene?

08:16.000 --> 08:18.080
I don't mind as long as I can move around.

08:18.250 --> 08:22.130
In the game, she wears a dress down past
her knees with boots, doesn't she? How's that?

08:22.540 --> 08:28.380
Yeah, that was cute! A comfortable,
casual dress that fits with Fiene's style. I agree!

08:28.540 --> 08:33.420
Let's go with that! Like a Magicombat Dress:
Commoner Style Edition, of sorts.

08:33.880 --> 08:37.710
Whatever that could be... but that's fine by me
as long as it's what you want, Fiene.

08:38.790 --> 08:41.880
Then I should go find Lieselotte...

08:41.880 --> 08:43.460
Please go and find her, quick!

08:43.460 --> 08:45.790
It's a much better use of your time
to go console an embarrassed Liese-tan

08:45.790 --> 08:48.290
than get in the way of Bal and
Fiene being sweet on each other!

08:48.290 --> 08:49.710
We're not going to do that!

08:52.920 --> 08:53.920
<b>A Broadcasting Club Production:</b>

08:52.920 --> 08:53.920
<b>The Story of Liese-tan and Sieg</b>

08:52.920 --> 08:53.920
<b>Script by Shihono Kobayashi</b>

08:56.000 --> 08:56.960
No way.

08:57.380 --> 08:57.920
What?!

08:58.080 --> 08:58.790
Whew...

08:58.790 --> 08:59.920
It's a total sugar overdose.

09:00.330 --> 09:04.420
And with you two playing the leads
the embarrassment will be pure torture!

09:06.080 --> 09:07.790
We want to talk to you alone after this.

09:08.830 --> 09:09.920
Okay...?

09:11.540 --> 09:14.830
Don't use the school festival for
your public display of affection!

09:14.830 --> 09:18.460
The few times we visit the clubroom,
the atmosphere's so saccharine it kills us.

09:18.790 --> 09:21.040
Get a room, you stupid couple.

09:21.040 --> 09:22.130
Um...

09:22.130 --> 09:22.710
Huh?

09:22.710 --> 09:27.330
I'll gladly take the scolding, but we really aren't going out.

09:27.920 --> 09:33.080
I mean, from your perspective,
do you think Kobayashi has any interest in me?

09:33.080 --> 09:36.580
I'm here feeling like she's so oblivious it hurts!

09:37.290 --> 09:40.250
W-well, I don't think she hates you, at least.

09:40.250 --> 09:42.460
Sure, she doesn't hate me.

09:42.460 --> 09:48.040
But I want to know what's beyond that!
Am I the same as any other guy around, or not?!

09:48.040 --> 09:49.920
What do you think, former Prez?!

09:51.040 --> 09:52.210
How should I know?!

09:52.580 --> 09:55.250
Go ahead and confess already! And get rejected!

09:56.960 --> 10:02.960
<b>Murder at the Masquerade Ball</b>

09:56.960 --> 10:02.960
<b>Hanahashi Ikuei High School Broadcasting Club</b>

09:57.210 --> 09:57.920
Huh?

09:58.130 --> 10:02.790
That's the whodunit quiz-style mystery drama
we did back when we were first-years.

10:03.080 --> 10:06.460
No one's gonna remember it anyway,
so go ahead and use it with some adjustments.

10:06.460 --> 10:09.670
Wait, did you call me here to hand me this?

10:09.670 --> 10:14.250
No, only because we were ticked off
by your lovey-doveyness, okay?

10:19.380 --> 10:21.330
Oh, we should cut out this line here.

10:22.040 --> 10:23.630
Next, we insert a loud scream.

10:23.630 --> 10:24.250
Yup!

10:24.540 --> 10:26.580
Have you decided on a dress for the ball?

10:26.580 --> 10:27.250
Of course!

10:27.500 --> 10:29.130
Did you find a partner already?

10:29.580 --> 10:30.250
Well, actually...

10:30.250 --> 10:32.000
It's so soon. I can hardly wait.

10:32.000 --> 10:32.750
I know!

10:33.040 --> 10:35.170
I'm sure I'm going to be killed off next!

10:35.170 --> 10:37.540
Oh, why must we succumb to such a fate?!

10:37.540 --> 10:39.080
Who could the killer be?!

10:39.460 --> 10:42.000
You realize this means we're all potential suspects!

10:43.420 --> 10:47.040
How lovely! Lieselotte, you really look splendid!

10:47.250 --> 10:48.080
Thank you.

10:53.250 --> 10:56.790
So this is where the Witch of Yore will appear?

10:57.040 --> 10:58.460
Yes, exactly!

10:58.460 --> 11:00.330
That was what happened in the game.

11:00.750 --> 11:03.420
Indeed, that is what the gods predict.

11:03.420 --> 11:07.130
Hmm, so this is where the
Witch of Yore makes her appearance.

11:10.830 --> 11:13.670
I was hoping you could help out, Leon.

11:17.580 --> 11:22.330
Then in addition to those of us appointed by the gods,
let us station our best knights here.

11:22.330 --> 11:23.670
Yes, please do.

11:23.670 --> 11:27.960
<b>The Royal Academy of Magic-Outside the Grand Hall</b>

11:23.670 --> 11:27.960
<b>Marquis Riefenstahl</b>

11:23.670 --> 11:27.960
<b>Let us station our best knights here.</b>

11:23.880 --> 11:26.250
Isn't this a bit overkill?

11:26.540 --> 11:31.080
Well, if we want everybody to survive
I think a bit too much is just about right.

11:31.080 --> 11:34.210
At this point it feels like we're just picking on the witch.

11:34.830 --> 11:38.420
We'll position Cecilie to the right of Fabian...

11:38.420 --> 11:39.210
Huh?!

11:39.210 --> 11:42.830
Uh, is Miss Cecilie coming on the day as well?

11:42.830 --> 11:43.630
Yes.

11:44.000 --> 11:47.210
The other day, we invited Fabian to our home, and...

11:48.210 --> 11:51.290
This is Fabian, son of Viscount Oltenberg.

11:51.580 --> 11:53.210
P-pleased to make your acquaintance...

11:55.830 --> 11:59.500
He was granted special acceptance
to the academy as a genius of magic.

11:59.500 --> 12:00.830
It's a pleasure.

12:03.420 --> 12:07.130
She fell in love at first sight,
and declared that she would marry him.

12:07.130 --> 12:07.880
Ah...

12:08.670 --> 12:12.920
Since then, Cecilie has thrust her way through
the induction trial to become a knight

12:12.920 --> 12:15.420
so that she could become Fabian's bodyguard.

12:15.710 --> 12:16.920
That demanding trial?!

12:17.330 --> 12:19.630
Yes, and even as we speak...

12:21.710 --> 12:22.540
Burn!

12:25.380 --> 12:26.960
Amazing, Fabian!

12:26.960 --> 12:30.290
Fabian is off training and she refuses to leave his side.

12:31.000 --> 12:35.080
Um, so is Miss Cecilie officially his fiancée now?

12:35.290 --> 12:38.330
Fabian still seems hesitant, but as it stands...

12:39.790 --> 12:43.920
I will protect Fabian forever
and I swear we will get married.

12:44.250 --> 12:47.040
If I can't do that, I would rather die.

12:47.460 --> 12:49.170
That's what she says.

12:49.750 --> 12:52.540
Who would have thought the girl had
that much passion inside of her?

12:52.830 --> 12:57.040
Well, the members of the Riefenstahl family
are all very passionate, Liese-tan included.

12:58.670 --> 13:04.630
Indeed, Liese here loved me for so long,
ever since we first met when she was five.

13:04.630 --> 13:05.330
Wha-?!

13:05.580 --> 13:06.380
Indeed.

13:06.750 --> 13:11.000
"If someone else takes His Highness away from me,
I'd kill that someone and die myself!"

13:11.000 --> 13:12.380
...was the impression I got.

13:12.670 --> 13:16.710
In the game she actually tries to kill Fiene
and ends up dying herself.

13:17.000 --> 13:20.540
Well, all because Liese-tan loved Sieg
so much, of course.

13:21.710 --> 13:24.960
Liese, thank you for giving me your love all this time.

13:25.250 --> 13:25.960
Hmm?

13:29.920 --> 13:30.790
Your Highness!

13:31.420 --> 13:34.040
"Loved you for so long"? "All this time"?

13:34.040 --> 13:36.670
Why are you talking about that in the past tense
as if it's done and over with?!

13:36.670 --> 13:37.330
Huh?

13:37.670 --> 13:39.960
Don't underestimate my feelings for you!

13:40.170 --> 13:44.630
Even if you ever have a change of heart,
I will continue to love you for the rest of my life.

13:44.630 --> 13:49.330
I absolutely refuse to concede my position as your wife,
even if it means intervening by force!

13:49.790 --> 13:52.000
The tsundereally-pissed makes a glorious return!

13:52.000 --> 13:57.830
Though she says "by force," Liese-tan's too nice to do
much more than challenge the person to a fair duel.

13:58.250 --> 14:00.830
Oh, I can't take it anymore.

14:01.080 --> 14:04.290
Huh? Uh, what- No...

14:04.290 --> 14:05.830
But my father and the others are watching...

14:06.000 --> 14:08.790
Liese, I'll just be waiting over that way.

14:08.790 --> 14:10.080
You love birds have fun.

14:10.670 --> 14:13.080
Y-Your Highness, it's hot. It's too hot for this!

14:13.290 --> 14:14.210
"Sieg."

14:15.880 --> 14:19.630
Please, Liese. I wish you would start calling me that.

14:21.250 --> 14:25.130
I'm so embarrassed.
I think my heart is going to explode...

14:25.420 --> 14:27.500
So please, won't you let go of me...

14:28.540 --> 14:29.250
Sieg?

14:37.080 --> 14:38.500
S-Sieg...

14:41.420 --> 14:42.540
Sieg!

14:49.500 --> 14:51.380
It's been a decade since that day.

14:52.670 --> 14:57.830
Your Highness, this is the eldest daughter
of House Riefenstahl, Lieselotte.

15:03.330 --> 15:06.670
I've never seen a girl this pretty.

15:09.880 --> 15:11.170
A... prince!

15:12.170 --> 15:14.380
Hey, let's go play together!

15:23.250 --> 15:24.670
Mother, listen!

15:24.960 --> 15:26.380
What is it, Sieg?

15:26.750 --> 15:29.290
I got to meet my future fiancée!

15:29.630 --> 15:32.040
Oh my, someone sounds happy.

15:32.250 --> 15:35.040
Well, she was so very cute!

15:35.830 --> 15:37.040
That's wonderful.

15:37.580 --> 15:38.420
Uh-huh!

15:40.250 --> 15:42.080
Huh? Lieselotte's here?

15:42.710 --> 15:44.670
Yes, she headed over to the courtyard.

15:45.630 --> 15:46.580
Prince Sieg!

15:47.710 --> 15:52.420
Lieselotte! I just found some flowers over there
that have a similar color to your eyes!

15:54.880 --> 15:55.710
Huh?

15:56.630 --> 15:57.710
I...

15:58.170 --> 16:01.960
I do not like you in the slightest, Your Highness!

16:06.380 --> 16:10.420
Mother, what do you suppose I did wrong?

16:10.830 --> 16:14.960
I imagine little Lieselotte simply got a little embarrassed.

16:15.380 --> 16:16.130
You think so?

16:16.500 --> 16:21.500
Yes. You two are going to be together
for years... decades, even.

16:21.750 --> 16:24.500
It's all right if you take your time
getting to know one another.

16:25.000 --> 16:26.790
Of course! You're right.

16:27.170 --> 16:31.210
But your attitude grew colder by the day.

16:31.920 --> 16:33.080
Lieselotte?

16:38.670 --> 16:40.580
It took us an awfully long time,

16:41.420 --> 16:43.250
but we're finally back on track.

16:44.080 --> 16:51.420
All this help from Lord Endoh and Lady Kobayashee
must be a blessing from the Creation Goddess Lirenna.

16:52.500 --> 16:57.460
I swear unto you,
if anyone tries to separate Liese and me,

16:58.040 --> 16:59.960
I will slay them with all of my might!

17:02.170 --> 17:06.170
<b>The 25th    Hanahashi Ikuei</b>

17:02.170 --> 17:06.170
<b>High School Festival</b>

17:02.460 --> 17:05.920
Our band will be performing in the auditorium
right after this at 1:00 p.m.!

17:06.670 --> 17:08.130
Hey, come get our food!

17:08.750 --> 17:09.790
Here's your yakisoba!

17:09.790 --> 17:11.580
We've got sausages straight off the grill!

17:11.670 --> 17:13.500
<b>A Broadcasting Club Production</b>

17:11.670 --> 17:13.500
<b>Dramatic Reading Mystery</b>

17:16.330 --> 17:18.960
It's poisoned!

17:16.670 --> 17:24.000
<b>A Dramatic Reading Mystery:</b>

17:16.670 --> 17:24.000
<b>The H</b>

17:16.670 --> 17:24.000
<b>High School Murders!</b>

17:19.920 --> 17:23.880
A dying scream echoes on a solitary island far out at sea.

17:24.380 --> 17:28.080
This was merely a prelude to the horrors about to begin.

17:28.830 --> 17:31.460
What do we do?! Three of us are dead already!

17:32.170 --> 17:34.670
We're all going to get killed!

17:35.290 --> 17:36.250
No...!

17:37.460 --> 17:39.250
Calm down, both of you!

17:44.670 --> 17:48.830
Listen up, murderer! You have nowhere left to run.
Now, show yourself!

17:53.170 --> 17:55.830
That's right, I'm the one who killed them all.

17:55.960 --> 17:58.000
I'm...the murderer!

18:04.750 --> 18:08.040
We're offering free drink tickets to those
who guessed the murderer right!

18:08.250 --> 18:10.130
Thank you very much!

18:13.000 --> 18:14.750
You were so good as the murderer!

18:14.750 --> 18:15.670
You really were!

18:15.670 --> 18:17.420
Oh uh, thanks!

18:17.880 --> 18:19.580
Hey, can we get your contact info?

18:19.580 --> 18:21.460
Let's go grab a coffee sometime!

18:21.920 --> 18:23.750
Uh, but I...

18:23.750 --> 18:25.000
C'mon, why not?

18:26.080 --> 18:28.670
What do you want with our club president?

18:29.170 --> 18:30.670
N-nothing...

18:30.670 --> 18:32.080
Um, well...

18:32.880 --> 18:34.420
Oh, there she is.

18:34.960 --> 18:35.880
Shihono!

18:35.880 --> 18:36.420
Huh?

18:37.420 --> 18:38.420
Sis?!

18:38.420 --> 18:40.630
Oh, your sister!

18:41.000 --> 18:42.250
I'm here!

18:42.960 --> 18:46.960
What do you mean, you here?
You could've told me you were coming.

18:46.960 --> 18:49.420
Hold on, you're Endo, aren't you?

18:49.420 --> 18:52.500
Oh... Uh, yes. It was nice to meet you the other day.

18:53.540 --> 18:57.210
S-so yeah, my sister graduated from here, too.

18:57.380 --> 18:58.540
She did?

18:58.540 --> 19:01.420
She goes to Wakabayama University now,

19:01.790 --> 19:05.250
which means she goes to
the same school as Kirise Kuon!

19:05.250 --> 19:06.080
Huh?

19:08.500 --> 19:09.670
That guy...

19:10.460 --> 19:14.000
Kuon... The same name as the "god"
in the Magikoi game...

19:14.380 --> 19:16.460
No that I've ever seen him around campus.

19:16.880 --> 19:21.380
But that's amazing that you got into
Wakabayama University from our high school.

19:21.920 --> 19:24.130
That's right, I am pretty great.

19:24.540 --> 19:27.420
I know! What if after this we-

19:27.420 --> 19:28.330
Sis!

19:29.130 --> 19:32.880
I'm just going to have a word with my sister outside.
Can you take over for me here?

19:32.880 --> 19:34.330
Uh sure, that's fine.

19:34.330 --> 19:36.790
I'll switch with you later. Sorry!

19:36.790 --> 19:37.960
Hey, Shihono?!

19:38.330 --> 19:39.500
Well, guess I'll see you!

19:45.790 --> 19:47.710
Honestly, that sister of mine...

19:47.960 --> 19:49.830
She's always so nosy!

19:50.920 --> 19:52.000
Done talking already?

19:52.000 --> 19:54.880
Yeah, she had to leave for some other plans.

19:54.880 --> 19:56.580
You should go take a break too, Endo.

19:56.580 --> 19:57.290
Okay.

20:04.710 --> 20:05.790
Endo!

20:05.790 --> 20:08.630
Huh? I thought you had to leave?

20:11.380 --> 20:13.330
Don't tell her I came back.

20:13.710 --> 20:14.630
Okay...

20:15.130 --> 20:19.330
That girl's hopeless at this kind of thing,
so I've been kind of worried.

20:19.460 --> 20:21.710
Uh, "hopeless"? At what?

20:21.710 --> 20:22.750
Nothing!

20:23.670 --> 20:27.420
So Endo, don't you have any interest in my little sister?

20:27.420 --> 20:29.420
Uh... Huh?

20:30.460 --> 20:31.540
Hmm?

20:32.080 --> 20:35.670
I think it's your sister who isn't interested, actually.

20:36.040 --> 20:37.130
I knew it...

20:37.880 --> 20:41.500
But that means you have some interest at least, Endo?

20:41.920 --> 20:44.670
Was I that obvious?

20:44.670 --> 20:45.920
Pretty much.

20:46.330 --> 20:48.670
But I want to hear it from you. Then that might make me
want to go all out and root for you.

20:49.170 --> 20:52.460
Well, you seem to know already so I'll say it,

20:52.460 --> 20:55.670
but I'm... totally in love.

20:56.420 --> 21:03.960
Sometimes I catch myself thinking, "How can you be so
cute?" and "Seriously, what are you, an angel?"

21:04.540 --> 21:08.170
Both inside and out, I can't imagine anyone more ideal.

21:08.170 --> 21:11.290
Anyway, I'm just hopelessly, head-over-heels in love.

21:12.750 --> 21:15.290
Hmm, I see, I see. But Shiho-

21:15.290 --> 21:16.250
Sis?!

21:19.420 --> 21:20.540
Oops...

21:21.380 --> 21:22.830
How much of that did she hear?!

21:23.170 --> 21:25.960
Didn't I specifically ask you not to meddle with things?!

21:25.960 --> 21:31.380
Uh, well... I was just about to go home
when I happened to glimpse Endo, so...

21:31.830 --> 21:34.250
Did my sister tell you anything weird?

21:34.670 --> 21:36.500
Huh?! Nothing, really...

21:36.500 --> 21:39.210
Sorry, Shihono! I'll get going, okay?

21:52.460 --> 21:53.380
Eve...

21:54.670 --> 21:56.630
You belong to me!

22:01.380 --> 22:03.710
Very soon, the Witch of Yore will return...

22:32.920 --> 22:34.080
I'm ready for you...

22:34.670 --> 22:37.170
Witch of Yore.

22:43.670 --> 22:49.670
Your smile is so stunning it almost hurts

22:49.670 --> 22:55.330
Even now, I can't look at it straight on

22:55.790 --> 23:01.920
The feelings scattered in the depths of my heart

23:01.920 --> 23:07.580
It's as if I'm gathering them bit by bit

23:08.540 --> 23:14.290
Do the stars in the night sky

23:15.290 --> 23:20.380
...see everything? ...know everything?

23:21.460 --> 23:27.000
I open the window and ask of them

23:27.630 --> 23:31.000
Why?

23:32.790 --> 23:38.960
This world is filled with glimmering light

23:39.080 --> 23:45.080
It was your smile that taught me so

23:45.080 --> 23:51.080
I can't help but wish for a happy ending

23:51.460 --> 24:01.290
If only I can stay by your side

24:01.290 --> 24:03.130
Forevermore

24:07.500 --> 24:09.460
Forevermore

24:13.710 --> 24:14.750
Fabian!

24:14.750 --> 24:16.000
Cecilie!

24:16.000 --> 24:17.290
Ready, and...

24:17.460 --> 24:20.750
Next Episode: The Lirene Flower, the Ball, and the Witch.

24:20.750 --> 24:24.670
Gaah! The youngest official couple is just too adorable!

24:24.670 --> 24:26.750
Agh, I can't!

24:24.960 --> 24:28.040
<b>The Lirene Flower, the Ball, and the Witch</b>
